  "body": "e.g. if I use the filter `{\"types\":\"m.room.message\"}` instead of `{\"types\":[\"m.room.message\"]}`, Synapse doesn't realise it's given a string instead of a list and tries to filter on events which types are either `m`, or `.`, or `r`, or `o`, etc.",
